Gate and you took my Lysa. Look down, General. That is what you are fighting for, and it has never once thanked anyone.","strategy":["The Directorate strike group sits in the atmosphere along the south: nothing can target a unit inside it. Keep your machines north of row 18 and let it waste its turns.","Go for the anchorage's west mouth (rows 6-8): mines and three Fenrirs screen it. Clear them with artillery and fighters.","Bring the captured Abaddon up behind the screen. From up to four hexes away its Quantum Decimator erases a carrier and everything next to it; don't move it on the turn it fires.","Send a second group around through the south mouth (columns 47-49) so the carriers can't all hide in the corner.","A relief group arrives from the north on turn 8. By then the carriers should already be burning."],"plan":[{"n":1,"at":[20,23],"note":"untargetable"},{"n":2,"path":[[7,8],[20,9],[33,7],[39,7]]},{"n":3,"path":[[5,12],[25,12],[37,9]]},{"n":4,"path":[[8,17],[28,14],[44,16],[48,13]]},{"n":5,"at":[30,1],"note":"Relief T8"}],"comms":[{"speaker":"kessrin","text":"You took my Gate and you took my Lysa. Look down, General. That is what you are fighting for, and it has never once thanked anyone."},{"speaker":"sato","text":"Four carriers in the asteroid ring to the north-east. Every fighter that hits Olympos tomorrow launches from one of them."},{"speaker":"ruess","text":"The Abaddon we pulled out of the Gate's yard is flying. One Decimator, four hexes, no carrier survives it. Please don't waste it on a Mars."},{"speaker":"sato","text":"Stay out of reach of the atmosphere. Their strike group is sitting in it, and nothing we have can touch it in there."},{"speaker":"moraine","text":"Whatever happened between us, General, Kessrin owes us both. Sink his carriers and I'll stop counting."}]}